GET {{baseUrl}}/oauth/me

::: auth oauth2
profile = sample-query

::: post
test("the token goes in the query", () => {
  expect(res.status).toBe(200);
  expect(res.json().via).toBe("query");
});

::: docs
The profile `sample-query` authenticates the client in the body and sends the token as the
`access_token` query parameter.
